     "<u></u> \r\n \r\n     \r\n         \r\n          \r\n         \r\n     \r\n    <div style=\"color:#333;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.429\"> \r\n        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#f5f5f5;border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n             \r\n            <tr> \r\n                <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 20px\"> \r\n                    <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;vertical-align:top;width:32px;padding-right:8px\"> <img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/h80FUlMtsrC9g3ObS6I5QjcDBqEHHlSYsLDyUabvzVJCCzx2D-3X-tBeuuenD-wc57MD_j-hQfGFQFJUXbASWK9i3V4VxveN3F4yQQlLi466kUS-cMI9P0bLHRbyQ32t=s0-d-e1-ft#https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d02430294d7ef173bcc2d468e37d1f1c?d=mm&amp;s=48\" height=\"32\" width=\"32\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-radius:3px;vertical-align:top\"> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                            <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;vertical-align:middle;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> <a rel=\"eric.walk nofollow\" href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=eric.walk\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Deric.walk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240880780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16Qt014u7LWjMCtRSN8R2a\">Eric Walk</a> <strong>created</strong> an issue \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                    </table> \r\n                </td> \r\n            </tr> \r\n            <tr> \r\n                <td style=\"paddin