 href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=eric.walk\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Deric.walk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240880780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16Qt014u7LWjMCtRSN8R2a\">Eric Walk</a> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:0 0 10px 0\"> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">Please document the dependencies required and where to obtain them. Also how to update the build scripts to use internal repo servers.</p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">Most servers have no internet access.</p> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;